# CURSOR DIRECTIVES

## Language Policy
- All code comments must be in ENGLISH
- All variable names must be in ENGLISH  
- All compiler messages and outputs must be in ENGLISH
- All documentation must be in ENGLISH
- All commit messages must be in ENGLISH
- Chat with user preferred in italian

## Project Context
This is Neutrino: Privacy-First Static Site Boilerplate - an international open source project targeting developers worldwide.

## Code Style
- Use English for all technical content
- Maintain professional, clear English
- Use standard web development terminology
